<p>Salutations. Long time, first time. I plan to read and possibly vote and offer feedback. I've been away from this site for a while. When I came back, there was a Series 6! I thought to myself, &quot;hey, you mostly stick to old, proven works, why not jump into new stuff?&quot; So I did. Then I thought, &quot;if you really like some of these articles, why not join so you can offer some feedback?&quot; And now I'm writing this.</p>
<p>&quot;When is the last time it rained?&quot; I've never experienced a drought nor do I live in an area where droughts really happen. Nevertheless, when that thought pops into my mind I have to try and figure out the last time there was rainfall or I cannot sleep.</p>

